  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Steps to Reproduce:\n- Load into an instance\n- Put the Steam Deck to sleep by tapping power.\n- Tap power again after a time to wake it up.\n- Get kicked out of the world you were in, arrive at world loading screen, click Go to enter the world.\n- (At this point you may or may not be connected at all to VRChat services??)\n- Send an invite from vrchat.com\n- It never arrives\nWorkaround:\n- Close VRChat\n- Open VRChat again\n- All the invites sent in the previous session arrive.\nWhat should happen:\n- Wake the Steam Deck up\n- World instance closes\n- Refresh the entire session as a \"new session\".\n- Return user to previous instance.",
